Source: treeseed-ai
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: TreeSeed AI Releases <releases@treeseed.ai>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), nodejs, curl, xz-utils, gnupg
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/treeseed-ai/ai
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: treeseed-ai
Architecture: amd64
Depends: systemd, ca-certificates, curl, gnupg, openssl, apt (>= 2.4)
Description: TreeAI managed platform bootstrap and recovery seed
 Installs signed repository configuration and asynchronously converges the
 selected TreeAI platform through its repository-managed lifecycle manager.

Package: treeseed-ai-archive-keyring
Architecture: all
Description: TreeAI stable APT archive public keyring
 Contains the public OpenPGP key used to authenticate the stable TreeAI APT
 repository. It contains no private signing material.

Package: treeseed-ai-development-archive-keyring
Architecture: all
Description: TreeAI development APT archive public keyring
 Contains the independent public OpenPGP key used to authenticate development
 TreeAI APT generations. It contains no private signing material.

Package: treeseed-ai-host-js-runtime
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ca-certificates
Description: Private pinned JavaScript runtime for TreeAI
 Provides the pinned Node executable used only by TreeAI management services.
 It does not replace or modify the host's /usr/bin/node installation.

Package: treeseed-ai-manager
Architecture: amd64
Depends: treeseed-ai-host-js-runtime (>= 0.6.0), treeseed-ai-cli (>= 0.6.0), treeseed-ai-release-catalog (>= 0.6.0), treeseed-ai-archive-keyring, treeseed-ai-development-archive-keyring, apt, curl, openssl, systemd
Breaks: treeseed-ai-host-runtime (<< 0.6.0)
Replaces: treeseed-ai-host-runtime (<< 0.6.0)
Description: Transactional lifecycle and update manager for TreeAI
 Reconciles cataloged packages, immutable container images, migrations,
 services, exclusive GPU modes, monitoring, and known-good recovery state.

Package: treeseed-ai-cli
Architecture: amd64
Depends: treeseed-ai-host-js-runtime (>= 0.6.0), ca-certificates
Description: Unified command-line interface for TreeAI
 Discovers installed command descriptors and provides authenticated monitoring
 plus fixed local supervisor operations through one treeai command.

Package: treeseed-ai-release-catalog
Architecture: all
Description: TreeAI signed release deployment catalog
 Declares exact package versions, immutable image digests, compatibility,
 service impact, migrations, health gates, and rollback policy.

Package: treeseed-ai-host-runtime
Architecture: amd64
Depends: treeseed-ai-cli (>= 0.6.0), treeseed-ai-host-js-runtime (>= 0.6.0), ca-certificates, curl, gnupg
Description: Docker and NVIDIA host capability integration for TreeAI
 Provides explicit plan, apply, and verify operations for supported Docker and
 NVIDIA Container Toolkit installations without owning GPU drivers.

Package: treeseed-ai-inference
Architecture: amd64
Depends: treeseed-ai-cli (>= 0.6.0), treeseed-ai-host-js-runtime (>= 0.6.0), openssl
Recommends: treeseed-ai-manager (>= 0.6.0), treeseed-ai-host-runtime (>= 0.6.0)
Description: Containerized TreeAI inference platform
 Provides authenticated inference control, OpenAI-compatible proxying, model
 and adapter lifecycle, evaluation, ranking, promotion, and rollback services.

Package: treeseed-ai-training
Architecture: amd64
Depends: treeseed-ai-cli (>= 0.6.0), treeseed-ai-host-js-runtime (>= 0.6.0), openssl
Recommends: treeseed-ai-manager (>= 0.6.0), treeseed-ai-host-runtime (>= 0.6.0)
Description: Containerized TreeAI training platform
 Provides document preparation, supervised QLoRA training, signed artifact
 creation, verification, archival, and restoration services.

Package: treeseed-ai-lab
Architecture: amd64
Depends: treeseed-ai-cli (>= 0.6.0), treeseed-ai-host-js-runtime (>= 0.6.0), openssl
Recommends: treeseed-ai-manager (>= 0.6.0), treeseed-ai-inference (>= 0.6.0), treeseed-ai-training (>= 0.6.0)
Description: TreeAI Hermes and Open WebUI experience laboratory
 Provides isolated agent and browser-chat clients, experience capture, dataset
 preparation, and a guarded continuous adapter-improvement loop.

Package: treeseed-ai-factory
Architecture: amd64
Depends: treeseed-ai-manager (>= 0.6.0)
Description: Transitional TreeAI factory dependency
 Preserves upgrades from the former exact-version meta-package while desired
 products and lifecycle ownership move to treeseed-ai-manager.
